        Args:
            flags: Gst.MemoryFlags
            data: data to
                wrap
            maxsize: allocated size of data
            offset: offset in data
            user_data: user_data
            notify: called with user_data when the memory is freed

        Returns:
            a new Gst.Memory.
        """

