        that can handle any stream format, but requires caps that are acceptable for
        all opposite pads.

        Args:
            query: an ACCEPT_CAPS Gst.Query.

        Returns:
            True if query could be executed
        """
    def proxy_query_caps(self, query: Query) -> _bool:
        """Calls Gst.Pad.query_caps() for all internally linked pads of self and returns
        the intersection of the results.

        This function is useful as a default caps query function for an element
        that can handle any stream format, but requires all its pads to have
        the same caps.  Two such elements are tee and adder.

        Args:
            query: a CAPS Gst.Query.

        Returns:
            True if query could be executed
        """
    def pull_range(self, offset: _int, size: _int) -> _tuple[FlowReturn, Buffer]:
